IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VALIDATE-CUST.
       AUTHOR. INTEGRATION TEST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY CUSTOMER-REC.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           COPY CUSTOMER-REC REPLACING CUSTOMER-RECORD BY LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
       01  LS-VALIDATION-RESULT.
           COPY CUSTOMER-REC REPLACING VALIDATION-RESULT BY LS-VALIDATION-RESULT.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD LS-VALIDATION-RESULT.
       MAIN-PARA.
           * Initialize validation result
           SET VALID-OK OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE.
           MOVE SPACES TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT.
           MOVE ZERO TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT.

           * Validate CUST-ID
           IF CUST-ID OF LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD = ZEROS
               SET VALID-ERROR OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE
               MOVE "Customer ID cannot be zero" TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               MOVE 101 TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

           IF CUST-ID OF LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD NOT NUMERIC
               SET VALID-ERROR OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE
               MOVE "Customer ID must be numeric" TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               MOVE 102 TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

           * Validate CUST-NAME
           IF CUST-NAME OF LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD = SPACES
               SET VALID-ERROR OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE
               MOVE "Customer name is required" TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               MOVE 103 TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

           * Validate CUST-BALANCE
           IF CUST-BALANCE OF LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD < ZERO
               SET VALID-ERROR OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE
               MOVE "Balance cannot be negative" TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               MOVE 104 TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

           * Validate CUST-STATUS
           IF CUST-STATUS OF LS-CUSTOMER-RECORD NOT = 'A'
               AND NOT = 'I'
               AND NOT = 'S'
               SET VALID-ERROR OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT TO TRUE
               MOVE "Invalid customer status" TO ERROR-MSG OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               MOVE 105 TO ERROR-CODE OF LS-VALIDATION-RESULT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

           * All validations passed
           GOBACK.